  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT TOWARDS THE 16 DAYS OF ACTIVISM AGAINST GB V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To mark the 16 days of activism, the organisation intends to use their online media to tackle Gender-based Violence (GBV) in Sierra Leone. The objectives are; - Increase public awareness on GBV with a focus on women and girls in remote communities using online social and public media platforms. - Contribute to changing public perception about GBV and cultivating action from men in support of addressing GBV in Sierra Leone.- Mobilize high level stakeholder continued interest and engagement in addressing GBV in Sierra Leone.</narrative>
  </description>
